ving ITI Certification in relevant trade from NCVT/SCVT approved Institution will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Railway RRC ER Apprentice Online Form 2025 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://rrcer.org/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the RRC ER before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result 2025</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for Railway RRC ER Apprentice recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे ।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Railway RRC ER Apprentice Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Merit List on the Basis of Marks</span></